### Running application version and GitHub update availability
# version includes build metadata; latestVersion and newVersionAvailable drive the footer.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/version
Accept: application/json

### Public UI configuration: persistentLoginSeconds and privacyNotice (null when disabled)
# Published notice fields: operatorName, contactEmail and details.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/configuration
Accept: application/json

### API liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### API and database readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json
